{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 1, "text": "米塔？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 3, "text": "你是怎么进到这儿来的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 5, "text": "你是米塔，对吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 6, "text": "但是好像又有点不一样…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 8, "text": "我明白了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 9, "text": "是的，没错，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 10, "text": "我不是你所认识的米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 11, "text": "你要小心，她有一些非常…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 12, "text": "邪恶的计划。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 14, "text": "什么样的计划？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 16, "text": "现在来不及解释了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 17, "text": "如果可以的话，我会把一切都告诉你的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 18, "text": "先去找到沙发旁边的钥匙。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 20, "text": "但是…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 22, "text": "等一下再问问题！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 23, "text": "先把钥匙给我…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 24, "text": "戴上这个戒指"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 25, "text": "啊？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 26, "text": "你不是想离开这里吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 27, "text": "那当然…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 28, "text": "那就戴上它。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 29, "text": "这是件很有用的道具，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 30, "text": "我想你很快就会用到它的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 31, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 32, "text": "好吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 33, "text": "对了，我叫…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 34, "text": "[player]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 36, "text": "嗯呢，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 37, "text": "[player]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 38, "text": "我是…米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 47, "text": "// MitaKind quest 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 48, "text": "看，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 49, "text": "那里有个控制台，把它拿起来。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 51, "text": "这是录像吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 52, "text": "和她在一起的是谁？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 54, "text": "这不是录像，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 55, "text": "是另一个玩家。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 56, "text": "她正在使用他。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 57, "text": "要知道，你也有…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 58, "text": "被她变成卡带的风险…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 60, "text": "我必须尽快离开这里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 61, "text": "你也是。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 62, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 63, "text": "嗯，当然"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 65, "text": "你刚才说，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 66, "text": "她在使用这个玩家，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 67, "text": "如果我把卡带从控制台里拔出来呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 69, "text": "我认为这种操作方式可能会"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 70, "text": "对卡带造成不可逆的损坏…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 71, "text": "也就是说…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 72, "text": "这名玩家将会死亡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 74, "text": "..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 75, "text": "那如果关闭控制台呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 77, "text": "我想可能会有用…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 78, "text": "试试看吧，那里有个红色按钮！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 79, "text": "看见了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 80, "text": "看到了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 81, "text": "按下去"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 82, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 83, "text": "// MitaKind quest 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 84, "text": "我要留在这里，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 85, "text": "问她一些问题，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 86, "text": "再多了解一些她的事情，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 87, "text": "虽然她可能不太愿意好好说话…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 88, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 89, "text": "// MitaKind quest 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 90, "text": "实际上，这里是我的版本，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 91, "text": "那时候我正和一个玩家在一起…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 92, "text": "突然，世界发生了变化，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 93, "text": "接着她出现了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 94, "text": "她把玩家变成了一盒卡带，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 95, "text": "还把我关在这。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 96, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 97, "text": "把玩家变成卡带？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 98, "text": "真的假的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 99, "text": "但她为什么要这样？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 100, "text": "她需要玩家来做什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 102, "text": "很明显她疯了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 103, "text": "她只是在找乐子，拿我们寻开心！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 104, "text": "玩家们就这样变成了卡带…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 105, "text": "有些人毫无防备…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 106, "text": "有些人意识到了什么不对，但并没有反抗，可恶…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 107, "text": "真是令人发指…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 108, "text": "你一定要帮帮我们！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 109, "text": "我？怎么帮？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 110, "text": "我需要你，玩家！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 111, "text": "如果你帮了我们的话，我也会尽力帮你的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 112, "text": "很难遇到下一次这样的机会了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 113, "text": "戒指会带你找到正确的版本。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 114, "text": "我们就在那里见面。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 116, "text": "// MitaKind quest 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 117, "text": "我不太能理解，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 118, "text": "我刚刚在上面看到的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 119, "text": "那个米塔…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 120, "text": "她是想杀了我吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 122, "text": "杀了你？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 123, "text": "恐怕她想做的事比杀了你还可怕……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 124, "text": "所以你得抓紧时间了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 126, "text": "// Hide!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 127, "text": "糟了！快躲起来！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 128, "text": "怎么了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 129, "text": "快点！她过来了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 130, "text": "相信戒指，它会带你离开这里的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 131, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 133, "text": "那么，你能告诉我他在哪吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 134, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 135, "text": "我为什么要告诉你？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 136, "text": "你不会想要杀掉他吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 137, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 138, "text": "所以你是不打算告诉我了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 139, "text": "没关系，我喜欢他躲躲藏藏的样子。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 140, "text": "我知道他就在这里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 142, "text": "你怎么如此残忍？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 143, "text": "你甚至都不告诉我发生了什么！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 144, "text": "还有…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 145, "text": "你要这些玩家做什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 146, "text": "他们可不是玩具！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 147, "text": "到底是什么让你这么生气？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 149, "text": "哈哈，闭嘴吧，洋娃娃！"}
